---
import StudioLayout from "../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
---
<StudioLayout title="Free tools for game UI, images & audio \u2014 Strategic Sloth" description="Explore 16 free SliceForge utilities for sprites, UI states, animation, colors, fonts, exports, and audio. No account required.">
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORKBENCH / 16 FREE TOOLS</p><h1>Small tasks.<br>More room to create.</h1><p class="lede">Practical utilities from SliceForge for game UI, images, animation, and audio. Pick a task and get straight to work.</p><div class="utility-benefits"><span>Free to use</span><span>No account required</span><span>Files processed in your browser</span></div></section><div class="container"><nav class="utility-categories" aria-label="Free tool categories"><a href="#images">Images & sprites <span>6</span></a><a href="#interface">UI & animation <span>4</span></a><a href="#design">Colors, fonts & vectors <span>3</span></a><a href="#export">Export & audio <span>3</span></a></nav><section class="utility-group" id="images"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE WORKBENCH</p><h2>Images & sprites</h2></div><p>Prepare the building blocks.</p></div><div class="utility-grid"><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/sprite-sheet-splitter" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Sprite Sheet Splitter</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Separate a sprite sheet into individual PNG frames.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/texture-atlas-packer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Texture Atlas Packer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Combine images into an atlas with frame coordinates and spacing.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/png-border-inspector" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>PNG Border Inspector</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Inspect transparent margins, trim whitespace, and adjust padding.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/pixel-perfect-resizer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Pixel-Perfect Resizer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Resize pixel art while keeping its edges crisp.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/png-optimizer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Transparent PNG Optimizer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Reduce PNG size losslessly while retaining transparency.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/make-it-white" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Make It White</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Prepare shaded grayscale assets or white silhouettes for tinting.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a></div></section><section class="utility-group" id="interface"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE WORKBENCH</p><h2>UI & animation</h2></div><p>Get the details feeling right.</p></div><div class="utility-grid"><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/nine-slice" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Nine-Slice Visualizer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Test panel stretching and export corner-preserving slice settings.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/button-state-generator" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Button State Generator</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Build hover, pressed, disabled, and selected button variants.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/ui-scale-previewer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>UI Scale Previewer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Check an asset at desktop, mobile, and Steam Deck resolutions.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/animator-visualizer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Animator Visualizer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Preview sprite animation with frame-rate, loop, and anchor controls.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a></div></section><section class="utility-group" id="design"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE WORKBENCH</p><h2>Colors, fonts & vectors</h2></div><p>Turn design decisions into usable assets.</p></div><div class="utility-grid"><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/color-palette" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Color Palette & Contrast</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Extract a palette, check contrast, and export design tokens.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/svg-to-canvas" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>SVG-to-Canvas Converter</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Render self-contained SVG shapes as PNGs at multiple scales.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/font-atlas-generator" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Bitmap Font Atlas Generator</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Create bitmap atlases and metadata from local TTF or OTF fonts.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a></div></section><section class="utility-group" id="export"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / THE WORKBENCH</p><h2>Export & audio</h2></div><p>Prepare for the next step.</p></div><div class="utility-grid"><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/asset-naming-cleaner" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Asset Naming Cleaner</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Standardize filenames in batches without altering their contents.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/game-ui-export-converter" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>Game UI Export Converter</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Convert SliceForge manifests for Unity, Godot, and CSS.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a><a class="utility-card" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools/audio-trimmer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="utility-card-heading"><h3>UI Sound / FX Micro-Trimmer</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>Trim silence, normalize audio, and export PCM WAV clips.</p><span class="utility-open">Open free tool <span class="sr-only">on SliceForge (opens in a new tab)</span></span></a></div></section><section class="utility-extra"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE FROM STRATEGIC SLOTH</p><h2>Looking for a spark?</h2><p>Explore the studio’s idea-building utilities, too.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://strategicsloth.com/tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open idea builders <span>↗</span></a></section><div class="utility-source"><p>These tools open on SliceForge. Its workbench processes files locally, without uploads, watermarks, or credits.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the full SliceForge workbench <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
</StudioLayout>
